{"title": "<span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Physical Properties of Matter</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">物质的物理性质</span>", "slides": [{"id": "c2-states:title", "h": "<div class=\"s-kicker\">🧊 <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Physical Properties of Matter</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">物质的物理性质</span></div><h2 class=\"s-title\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Matter and its states</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">物质与物质的状态</span></h2><p class=\"s-hook\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Push the plunger of a sealed syringe full of air and it slides in. Fill it with water and it will not budge. That one difference — how closely the particles are packed — explains every row of the states-of-matter table.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">推一支装满空气、封住口的针筒，活塞能推进去；装满水就推不动。就这一个差别——粒子挤得有多紧——解释了物质状态表的每一行。</span></span></p><div class=\"s-diff\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Difficulty</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">难度</span> <b>●○○</b></div><div class=\"s-meta\">⏱ 20 min · ★ <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">essential</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">必会</span></div>"}, {"id": "c2-states:keys", "h": "<div class=\"s-kicker\">🔑 <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Must know</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">必须记住</span> · <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Matter and its states</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">物质与物质的状态</span></div><ol class=\"s-list\"><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Matter = has mass + takes up space. 4 states: solid, liquid, gas, plasma.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">物质＝有质量＋占空间。4 种状态：固、液、气、等离子体。</span></div></li><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Solid: definite shape and volume. Liquid: indefinite shape, definite volume. Gas: both indefinite.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">固体：形状体积都固定。液体：形状不定、体积固定。气体：都不固定。</span></div></li><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Only gases are compressible (particles far apart).</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">只有气体可压缩（粒子相距远）。</span></div></li></ol><div class=\"s-fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 540 245\" class=\"fig wide\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"particles in solid, liquid and gas\"><defs><marker id=\"mvh\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"6\" markerHeight=\"6\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"mvh\"/></marker></defs><rect x=\"20\" y=\"20\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" rx=\"14\" class=\"cbox\"/><text x=\"95.0\" y=\"190\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"ct\"><tspan class=\"en\">SOLID</tspan><tspan class=\"zh\"> 固体</tspan></text><text x=\"95.0\" y=\"206\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl s en\">fixed shape & volume</text><text x=\"95.0\" y=\"221\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl s zh\">形状体积固定</text><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"150\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"68\" cy=\"150\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"94\" cy=\"150\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"150\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"146\" cy=\"150\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"124\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"68\" cy=\"124\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"94\" cy=\"124\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"124\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"146\" cy=\"124\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"98\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"68\" cy=\"98\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"94\" cy=\"98\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"98\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"146\" cy=\"98\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"42\" cy=\"72\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"68\" cy=\"72\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"94\" cy=\"72\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"120\" cy=\"72\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"146\" cy=\"72\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><rect x=\"195\" y=\"20\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" rx=\"14\" class=\"cbox\"/><text x=\"270.0\" y=\"190\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"ct\"><tspan class=\"en\">LIQUID</tspan><tspan class=\"zh\"> 液体</tspan></text><text x=\"270.0\" y=\"206\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl s en\">fixed volume, takes shape</text><text x=\"270.0\" y=\"221\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl s zh\">体积固定、形状随容器</text><circle cx=\"249\" cy=\"93\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"288\" cy=\"87\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"274\" cy=\"108\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"218\" cy=\"119\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"219\" cy=\"89\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"261\" cy=\"142\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"285\" cy=\"150\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"326\" cy=\"85\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"312\" cy=\"103\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"248\" cy=\"124\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"305\" cy=\"132\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"214\" cy=\"145\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"311\" cy=\"154\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"327\" cy=\"129\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"237\" cy=\"151\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"295\" cy=\"114\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><rect x=\"370\" y=\"20\" width=\"150\" height=\"150\" rx=\"14\" class=\"cbox\"/><text x=\"445.0\" y=\"190\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"ct\"><tspan class=\"en\">GAS</tspan><tspan class=\"zh\"> 气体</tspan></text><text x=\"445.0\" y=\"206\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl s en\">fills the container</text><text x=\"445.0\" y=\"221\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl s zh\">充满容器</text><circle cx=\"415\" cy=\"86\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><line x1=\"406\" y1=\"95\" x2=\"395\" y2=\"108\" class=\"mv\" marker-end=\"url(#mvh)\"/><circle cx=\"459\" cy=\"115\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><line x1=\"463\" y1=\"127\" x2=\"469\" y2=\"143\" class=\"mv\" marker-end=\"url(#mvh)\"/><circle cx=\"464\" cy=\"52\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><line x1=\"462\" y1=\"39\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"22\" class=\"mv\" marker-end=\"url(#mvh)\"/><circle cx=\"405\" cy=\"139\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><line x1=\"409\" y1=\"151\" x2=\"414\" y2=\"168\" class=\"mv\" marker-end=\"url(#mvh)\"/><circle cx=\"499\" cy=\"104\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><line x1=\"512\" y1=\"105\" x2=\"529\" y2=\"106\" class=\"mv\" marker-end=\"url(#mvh)\"/><circle cx=\"395\" cy=\"50\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><line x1=\"406\" y1=\"42\" x2=\"420\" y2=\"32\" class=\"mv\" marker-end=\"url(#mvh)\"/><circle cx=\"487\" cy=\"152\" r=\"11\" class=\"pa\"/><line x1=\"475\" y1=\"158\" x2=\"460\" y2=\"165\" class=\"mv\" marker-end=\"url(#mvh)\"/></svg></div>"}, {"id": "c2-states:fig0", "h": "<div class=\"s-kicker\">🖼️ <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Picture it</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">看图理解</span> · <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Matter and its states</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">物质与物质的状态</span></div><div class=\"s-fig\"><div class=\"mtree\"><ul><li><span class=\"tn d0\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Matter (has mass, takes up space)</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">物质（有质量、占空间）</span></span></span><ul><li><span class=\"tn d1\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Solid</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">固体</span></span><span class=\"tn-note\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">definite shape · definite volume · not compressible</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">定形 · 定体积 · 不可压缩</span></span></span></span></li><li><span class=\"tn d1\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Liquid</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">液体</span></span><span class=\"tn-note\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">takes container shape · definite volume · not compressible</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">随容器变形 · 定体积 · 不可压缩</span></span></span></span></li><li><span class=\"tn d1\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Gas</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">气体</span></span><span class=\"tn-note\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">no fixed shape or volume · compressible</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">形状体积都不定 · 可压缩</span></span></span></span></li><li><span class=\"tn d1\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Plasma</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">等离子体</span></span><span class=\"tn-note\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">very hot, charged gas (lightning, stars)</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">极热的带电气体（闪电、恒星）</span></span></span></span></li></ul></li></ul></div></div>"}, {"id": "c2-states:hard", "h": "<div class=\"s-kicker hard\">🧗 <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">The hard part</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">难点</span> · <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Matter and its states</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">物质与物质的状态</span></div><h3 class=\"s-h\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Linking particles to the property table</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">把粒子和性质表联系起来</span></span></h3><p class=\"s-why\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Students memorise the table but cannot explain it.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">学生背得出表，却解释不了。</span></span></p><ol class=\"s-steps\"><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Tight + fixed in place → keeps shape and volume (solid).</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">紧密＋位置固定→保持形状和体积（固体）。</span></div></li><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Touching but sliding → flows (shape changes), volume fixed (liquid).</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">接触但能滑动→能流动（形状变），体积固定（液体）。</span></div></li><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Far apart → fills container, compressible (gas).</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">相距远→充满容器、可压缩（气体）。</span></div></li></ol><div class=\"s-try\"><b><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Try</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">试一试</span></b> <div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Why does a liquid take the shape of its container?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">液体为什么会变成容器的形状？</span></div><details><summary><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Answer</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">答案</span></summary><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Its particles are touching but can slide past one another, so it flows.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">它的粒子相互接触但能彼此滑动，所以能流动。</span></div></details></div>"}, {"id": "c2-states:traps", "h": "<div class=\"s-kicker trap\">⚠️ <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Traps &amp; tip</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">陷阱与提示</span> · <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Matter and its states</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">物质与物质的状态</span></div><ul class=\"s-list traps\"><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Liquid has indefinite volume → it is the shape that changes; volume is definite.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">液体体积不固定 → 变的是形状，体积固定。</span></div></li></ul><div class=\"s-tnote\">🟡 <div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Your class notes list 4 common states including plasma, and say liquids are not compressible. Many textbooks list only 3 everyday states and say liquids are \"nearly\" incompressible. On this test: 4 states, and only gases are compressible.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">课堂讲义列出包括等离子体在内的 4 种常见状态，并说液体不可压缩。很多教材只列 3 种日常状态，说液体「几乎」不可压缩。考试按讲义：4 种状态，只有气体可压缩。</span></div></div><div class=\"s-tip\">🎯 <div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Picture each in a jar: keeps shape? fills the jar?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">想象放进罐子：保持形状吗？充满罐子吗？</span></div></div>"}, {"id": "c2-properties:title", "h": "<div class=\"s-kicker\">🧊 <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Physical Properties of Matter</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">物质的物理性质</span></div><h2 class=\"s-title\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Hardness, malleability, ductility, lustre, viscosity, diffusion, vapour</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">硬度、可锻性、延性、光泽、黏度、扩散、蒸气</span></h2><p class=\"s-hook\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Aluminum foil, copper wire, honey, a diamond ring, the smell of perfume crossing a room — each one is a different property word on your test. Match the object to the word and the marks are yours.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">铝箔、铜线、蜂蜜、钻戒、香水味飘满房间——每一个都对应考试里一个不同的性质词。把东西和词对上，分就到手了。</span></span></p><div class=\"s-diff\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Difficulty</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">难度</span> <b>●●○</b></div><div class=\"s-meta\">⏱ 30 min · ★ <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">essential</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">必会</span></div>"}, {"id": "c2-properties:keys", "h": "<div class=\"s-kicker\">🔑 <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Must know</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">必须记住</span> · <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Hardness, malleability, ductility, lustre, viscosity, diffusion, vapour</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">硬度、可锻性、延性、光泽、黏度、扩散、蒸气</span></div><ol class=\"s-list\"><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Malleable = sheets; ductile = wires; hardness = resists scratching; lustre = shiny vs dull.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">可锻性＝成片；延性＝成丝；硬度＝抗刮；光泽＝亮或暗。</span></div></li><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Viscosity = resistance to flow (honey high). Diffusion = high → low concentration to equilibrium.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">黏度＝抗流动（蜂蜜高）。扩散＝高→低浓度直到平衡。</span></div></li><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Vapour = gas from evaporation above 25 °C (class). Vapour pressure in kPa; water 3.2 kPa.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">蒸气＝高于 25 °C 汽化形成的气体（讲义）。蒸气压单位 kPa；水为 3.2 kPa。</span></div></li></ol><div class=\"s-fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 540 200\" class=\"fig wide\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"diffusion\"><rect x=\"10\" y=\"14\" width=\"230\" height=\"130\" rx=\"14\" class=\"cbox\"/><line x1=\"125\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"125\" y2=\"138\" class=\"memb\"/><circle cx=\"44\" cy=\"84\" r=\"6\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"56\" cy=\"90\" r=\"6\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"80\" cy=\"33\" r=\"6\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"23\" cy=\"115\" r=\"6\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"46\" cy=\"51\" r=\"6\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"115\" cy=\"76\" r=\"6\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"100\" cy=\"76\" r=\"6\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"81\" cy=\"42\" r=\"6\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"81\" cy=\"118\" r=\"6\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"71\" cy=\"105\" r=\"6\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"84\" cy=\"33\" r=\"6\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"93\" cy=\"89\" r=\"6\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"50\" cy=\"29\" r=\"6\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"102\" cy=\"76\" r=\"6\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"89\" cy=\"119\" r=\"6\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"88\" cy=\"124\" r=\"6\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"59\" cy=\"111\" r=\"6\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"63\" cy=\"125\" r=\"6\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"217\" cy=\"36\" r=\"6\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"148\" cy=\"49\" r=\"6\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"225\" cy=\"72\" r=\"6\" class=\"pa\"/><text x=\"125\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"ct\"><tspan class=\"en\">Before</tspan><tspan class=\"zh\"> 开始</tspan></text><text x=\"125\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl s\"><tspan class=\"en\">high → low concentration</tspan><tspan class=\"zh\"> 高浓度→低浓度</tspan></text><rect x=\"300\" y=\"14\" width=\"230\" height=\"130\" rx=\"14\" class=\"cbox\"/><line x1=\"415\" y1=\"20\" x2=\"415\" y2=\"138\" class=\"memb\"/><circle cx=\"370\" cy=\"58\" r=\"6\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"359\" cy=\"67\" r=\"6\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"345\" cy=\"88\" r=\"6\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"366\" cy=\"122\" r=\"6\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"375\" cy=\"124\" r=\"6\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"392\" cy=\"131\" r=\"6\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"374\" cy=\"43\" r=\"6\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"392\" cy=\"128\" r=\"6\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"396\" cy=\"86\" r=\"6\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"378\" cy=\"48\" r=\"6\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"502\" cy=\"87\" r=\"6\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"452\" cy=\"33\" r=\"6\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"504\" cy=\"131\" r=\"6\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"433\" cy=\"111\" r=\"6\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"463\" cy=\"42\" r=\"6\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"452\" cy=\"107\" r=\"6\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"506\" cy=\"31\" r=\"6\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"482\" cy=\"31\" r=\"6\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"492\" cy=\"61\" r=\"6\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"507\" cy=\"130\" r=\"6\" class=\"pa\"/><circle cx=\"472\" cy=\"132\" r=\"6\" class=\"pa\"/><text x=\"415\" y=\"166\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"ct\"><tspan class=\"en\">Later</tspan><tspan class=\"zh\"> 之后</tspan></text><text x=\"415\" y=\"184\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl s\"><tspan class=\"en\">equal = equilibrium</tspan><tspan class=\"zh\"> 浓度相等＝平衡</tspan></text><path d=\"M245 80 L292 80\" class=\"flowa\" marker-end=\"url(#fa)\"/><defs><marker id=\"fa\" viewBox=\"0 0 10 10\" refX=\"9\" refY=\"5\" markerWidth=\"7\" markerHeight=\"7\" orient=\"auto\"><path d=\"M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z\" class=\"mvh\"/></marker></defs></svg></div>"}, {"id": "c2-properties:fig0", "h": "<div class=\"s-kicker\">🖼️ <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Picture it</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">看图理解</span> · <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Hardness, malleability, ductility, lustre, viscosity, diffusion, vapour</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">硬度、可锻性、延性、光泽、黏度、扩散、蒸气</span></div><p class=\"s-why\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Malleability vs ductility</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">可锻性与延性</span></span></p><div class=\"s-fig\"><div class=\"cmp\"><div class=\"cmp-col l\"><div class=\"cmp-h\"><span class=\"en\">Malleability</span><span class=\"zh\"> 可锻性</span></div><div class=\"cmp-i\"><span class=\"en\">🔨 hammered into sheets</span><span class=\"zh\"> 敲成薄片</span></div><div class=\"cmp-i\"><span class=\"en\">e.g. aluminum foil</span><span class=\"zh\"> 例：铝箔</span></div></div><div class=\"cmp-vs\">vs</div><div class=\"cmp-col r\"><div class=\"cmp-h\"><span class=\"en\">Ductility</span><span class=\"zh\"> 延性</span></div><div class=\"cmp-i\"><span class=\"en\">🧵 drawn into wire</span><span class=\"zh\"> 拉成丝</span></div><div class=\"cmp-i\"><span class=\"en\">e.g. copper wire</span><span class=\"zh\"> 例：铜线</span></div></div></div></div>"}, {"id": "c2-properties:hard", "h": "<div class=\"s-kicker hard\">🧗 <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">The hard part</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">难点</span> · <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Hardness, malleability, ductility, lustre, viscosity, diffusion, vapour</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">硬度、可锻性、延性、光泽、黏度、扩散、蒸气</span></div><h3 class=\"s-h\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Malleable vs ductile</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">可锻性与延性</span></span></h3><p class=\"s-why\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Both mean \"shaped without breaking\", so students swap them.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">两者都是「成形而不破」，学生常搞反。</span></span></p><ol class=\"s-steps\"><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Ask: what shape comes out?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">问：做出来是什么形状？</span></div></li><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Flat sheet / foil / blade → malleable.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">平片／箔／刀身→可锻性。</span></div></li><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Long thin wire / thread → ductile.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">细长的丝／线→延性。</span></div></li></ol><div class=\"s-try\"><b><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Try</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">试一试</span></b> <div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Gold leaf for decorating a cake: malleable or ductile?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">装饰蛋糕用的金箔：可锻性还是延性？</span></div><details><summary><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Answer</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">答案</span></summary><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Malleable — it is a thin sheet.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">可锻性——它是薄片。</span></div></details></div>"}, {"id": "c2-properties:traps", "h": "<div class=\"s-kicker trap\">⚠️ <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Traps &amp; tip</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">陷阱与提示</span> · <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Hardness, malleability, ductility, lustre, viscosity, diffusion, vapour</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">硬度、可锻性、延性、光泽、黏度、扩散、蒸气</span></div><ul class=\"s-list traps\"><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Malleable = wire → no: malleable = sheet, ductile = wire.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">可锻性＝成丝 → 错：可锻性＝成片，延性＝成丝。</span></div></li><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">High viscosity = runny → high viscosity = thick, slow.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">黏度高＝稀 → 黏度高＝稠、流得慢。</span></div></li></ul><div class=\"s-tnote\">🟡 <div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Your class notes define vapour as gas formed by evaporation above room temperature (25 °C). Most textbooks define vapour as the gas of a substance that is normally a liquid or solid at room temperature, and note that evaporation happens at any temperature. On this test use the class version.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">课堂讲义把蒸气定义为高于室温（25 °C）时汽化形成的气体。多数教材的定义是：常温下本是液体或固体的物质所形成的气体，并指出任何温度下都会汽化。考试按讲义的说法。</span></div></div><div class=\"s-tip\">🎯 <div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Malleable → \"mallet\" (hammer) → sheet.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">malleable→mallet（锤子）→成片。</span></div></div>"}, {"id": "c2-system-phase:title", "h": "<div class=\"s-kicker\">🧊 <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Physical Properties of Matter</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">物质的物理性质</span></div><h2 class=\"s-title\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">System vs phase</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">体系与相</span></h2><p class=\"s-hook\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">A glass of iced cola: how many phases? Count the visible parts — ice, liquid, bubbles — and you have the answer. Questions like this are quick marks once you know the counting rule.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">一杯加冰的可乐有几个相？数一数看得见的部分——冰、液体、气泡——答案就出来了。掌握数相的规则，这类题就是送分题。</span></span></p><div class=\"s-diff\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Difficulty</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">难度</span> <b>●●○</b></div><div class=\"s-meta\">⏱ 25 min · ★ <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">essential</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">必会</span></div>"}, {"id": "c2-system-phase:keys", "h": "<div class=\"s-kicker\">🔑 <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Must know</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">必须记住</span> · <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">System vs phase</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">体系与相</span></div><ol class=\"s-list\"><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">System = what you are studying. Phase = a uniform part of the system.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">体系＝研究对象。相＝体系中均一的部分。</span></div></li><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Different states or layers = different phases. Gas mixtures = 1 phase. Solutions = 1 phase.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">不同状态或分层＝不同的相。气体混合物＝1 相。溶液＝1 相。</span></div></li><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Class T/F: looks uniform → one phase (True); boundary → more than one phase (True).</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">讲义判断题：看起来均匀→一个相（对）；有分界→不止一个相（对）。</span></div></li></ol><div class=\"s-fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 560 222\" class=\"fig wide\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"phases in beakers\"><rect x=\"32\" y=\"64\" width=\"126\" height=\"53\" fill=\"#f4c542\" class=\"lay\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"94\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl\"><tspan class=\"en\">oil</tspan><tspan class=\"zh\"> 油</tspan></text><rect x=\"32\" y=\"117\" width=\"126\" height=\"53\" fill=\"#7cc4f2\" class=\"lay\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl\"><tspan class=\"en\">water</tspan><tspan class=\"zh\"> 水</tspan></text><path d=\"M28 30 L32 170 L158 170 L162 30\" class=\"bk\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"194\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"ct en\" style=\"font-size:12px\">oil + water → 2 phases</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"211\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl s zh\">2 个相</text><rect x=\"212\" y=\"64\" width=\"126\" height=\"106\" fill=\"#9fd3f7\" class=\"lay\"/><text x=\"275\" y=\"121\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl\"><tspan class=\"en\">salt water</tspan><tspan class=\"zh\"> 盐水</tspan></text><path d=\"M208 30 L212 170 L338 170 L342 30\" class=\"bk\"/><text x=\"275\" y=\"194\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"ct en\" style=\"font-size:12px\">salt water → 1 phase</text><text x=\"275\" y=\"211\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl s zh\">1 个相</text><rect x=\"402\" y=\"50\" width=\"28\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#e8f6ff\" class=\"lay\"/><rect x=\"440\" y=\"56\" width=\"28\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#e8f6ff\" class=\"lay\"/><rect x=\"478\" y=\"50\" width=\"28\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#e8f6ff\" class=\"lay\"/><text x=\"455\" y=\"44\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl s\"><tspan class=\"en\">ice</tspan><tspan class=\"zh\"> 冰</tspan></text><rect x=\"392\" y=\"64\" width=\"126\" height=\"106\" fill=\"#7cc4f2\" class=\"lay\"/><text x=\"455\" y=\"121\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl\"><tspan class=\"en\">water</tspan><tspan class=\"zh\"> 水</tspan></text><path d=\"M388 30 L392 170 L518 170 L522 30\" class=\"bk\"/><text x=\"455\" y=\"194\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"ct en\" style=\"font-size:12px\">ice + water → 2 phases</text><text x=\"455\" y=\"211\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl s zh\">2 个相</text></svg></div>"}, {"id": "c2-system-phase:fig0", "h": "<div class=\"s-kicker\">🖼️ <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Picture it</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">看图理解</span> · <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">System vs phase</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">体系与相</span></div><p class=\"s-why\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Counting phases</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">数一数有几个相</span></span></p><div class=\"s-fig\"><svg viewBox=\"0 0 380 222\" class=\"fig wide\" role=\"img\" aria-label=\"phases in beakers\"><rect x=\"42\" y=\"50\" width=\"28\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#e8f6ff\" class=\"lay\"/><rect x=\"80\" y=\"56\" width=\"28\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#e8f6ff\" class=\"lay\"/><rect x=\"118\" y=\"50\" width=\"28\" height=\"22\" rx=\"4\" fill=\"#e8f6ff\" class=\"lay\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"44\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl s\"><tspan class=\"en\">ice</tspan><tspan class=\"zh\"> 冰</tspan></text><rect x=\"32\" y=\"64\" width=\"126\" height=\"53\" fill=\"#f4c542\" class=\"lay\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"94\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl\"><tspan class=\"en\">oil</tspan><tspan class=\"zh\"> 油</tspan></text><rect x=\"32\" y=\"117\" width=\"126\" height=\"53\" fill=\"#7cc4f2\" class=\"lay\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl\"><tspan class=\"en\">water</tspan><tspan class=\"zh\"> 水</tspan></text><path d=\"M28 30 L32 170 L158 170 L162 30\" class=\"bk\"/><text x=\"95\" y=\"194\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"ct en\" style=\"font-size:12px\">oil + water + ice → 3 phases</text><text x=\"95\" y=\"211\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl s zh\">3 个相</text><rect x=\"212\" y=\"64\" width=\"126\" height=\"53\" fill=\"#9fd3f7\" class=\"lay\"/><text x=\"275\" y=\"94\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl\"><tspan class=\"en\">water</tspan><tspan class=\"zh\"> 水</tspan></text><rect x=\"212\" y=\"117\" width=\"126\" height=\"53\" fill=\"#d9b77a\" class=\"lay\"/><text x=\"275\" y=\"148\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl\"><tspan class=\"en\">sand</tspan><tspan class=\"zh\"> 沙</tspan></text><path d=\"M208 30 L212 170 L338 170 L342 30\" class=\"bk\"/><text x=\"275\" y=\"194\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"ct en\" style=\"font-size:12px\">sand in water → 2 phases</text><text x=\"275\" y=\"211\" text-anchor=\"middle\" class=\"lbl s zh\">2 个相</text></svg></div>"}, {"id": "c2-system-phase:hard", "h": "<div class=\"s-kicker hard\">🧗 <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">The hard part</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">难点</span> · <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">System vs phase</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">体系与相</span></div><h3 class=\"s-h\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Counting phases with several states and layers</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">多状态、多分层时数相</span></span></h3><p class=\"s-why\"><span class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Students count substances or forget that gases merge into one phase.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">学生会去数物质，或忘了气体会合成一个相。</span></span></p><ol class=\"s-steps\"><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">All gases together → 1 phase.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">所有气体合起来→1 相。</span></div></li><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Each liquid layer → 1 phase each.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">每个液体层→各 1 相。</span></div></li><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Each different solid → 1 phase each. Add them up.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">每种不同的固体→各 1 相。加起来。</span></div></li></ol><div class=\"s-try\"><b><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Try</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">试一试</span></b> <div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Oil, water and ice cubes in a beaker (class example).</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">烧杯里有油、水和冰块（讲义例子）。</span></div><details><summary><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Answer</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">答案</span></summary><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">3 phases</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">3 个相</span></div></details></div>"}, {"id": "c2-system-phase:traps", "h": "<div class=\"s-kicker trap\">⚠️ <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Traps &amp; tip</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">陷阱与提示</span> · <span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">System vs phase</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">体系与相</span></div><ul class=\"s-list traps\"><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Two gases = 2 phases → gases always mix into 1 phase.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">两种气体＝2 相 → 气体总是混成 1 相。</span></div></li><li><div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Salt water = 2 phases (two substances) → 1 phase.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">盐水＝2 相（两种物质）→ 1 相。</span></div></li></ul><div class=\"s-tnote\">🟡 <div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Your class answer key marks \"If two substances look uniform throughout, they must be one phase\" as True. Many textbooks would add that looking uniform is a good sign but not proof. On this test answer True.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">课堂答案把「两种物质看起来处处均匀，就一定是一个相」判为「对」。很多教材会补充：看起来均匀是很好的迹象，但不是证明。考试按讲义答「对」。</span></div></div><div class=\"s-tip\">🎯 <div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Count visibly different parts, not substances.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">数看得见的不同部分，不是数物质。</span></div></div>"}], "cards": [{"id": "c2-states.c0", "f": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Definition of matter?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">物质的定义？</span></div>", "b": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Anything with mass that takes up space (volume).</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">有质量并占据空间（体积）的任何东西。</span></div>"}, {"id": "c2-states.c1", "f": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">The 4 common states?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">4 种常见状态？</span></div>", "b": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Solid, liquid, gas, plasma.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">固体、液体、气体、等离子体。</span></div>"}, {"id": "c2-states.c2", "f": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Which state is compressible?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">哪种状态可压缩？</span></div>", "b": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Gas only — its particles are far apart.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">只有气体——粒子相距很远。</span></div>"}, {"id": "c2-states.c3", "f": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Liquid: shape and volume?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">液体：形状和体积？</span></div>", "b": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Indefinite shape (takes the container's shape), definite volume.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">形状不固定（随容器），体积固定。</span></div>"}, {"id": "c2-states.c4", "f": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">How do liquid particles move?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">液体粒子怎么运动？</span></div>", "b": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">They stay in close contact but slide past one another.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">紧挨在一起，但能彼此滑动。</span></div>"}, {"id": "c2-properties.c0", "f": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Malleability?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">可锻性？</span></div>", "b": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Can be hammered or rolled into sheets without breaking (Al foil).</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">能被锤打或轧成薄片而不破裂（铝箔）。</span></div>"}, {"id": "c2-properties.c1", "f": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Ductility?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">延性（可拉成丝）？</span></div>", "b": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Can be drawn into a thin wire without breaking (copper wire). Water is not ductile.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">能被拉成细丝而不断（铜线）。水不具有延性。</span></div>"}, {"id": "c2-properties.c2", "f": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Hardness?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">硬度？</span></div>", "b": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Resistance to being scratched. Diamond: cannot be scratched.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">抵抗刮划的能力。钻石：刮不动。</span></div>"}, {"id": "c2-properties.c3", "f": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Viscosity: honey vs water?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">黏度：蜂蜜和水比？</span></div>", "b": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Honey high (flows slowly), water low (flows easily).</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">蜂蜜高（流得慢），水低（流得快）。</span></div>"}, {"id": "c2-properties.c4", "f": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Vapour (class definition) and vapour pressure unit?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">蒸气（讲义定义）和蒸气压单位？</span></div>", "b": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Gas from evaporation above room temperature (25 °C). Vapour pressure in kPa.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">高于室温（25 °C）汽化形成的气体。蒸气压单位 kPa。</span></div>"}, {"id": "c2-properties.c5", "f": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Diffusion direction?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">扩散的方向？</span></div>", "b": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">High → low concentration, until equilibrium (evenly spread).</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">高浓度→低浓度，直到平衡（均匀分布）。</span></div>"}, {"id": "c2-system-phase.c0", "f": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">System?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">体系？</span></div>", "b": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">The part of the universe you are studying — what you focus on.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">你正在研究的那部分宇宙——你关注的对象。</span></div>"}, {"id": "c2-system-phase.c1", "f": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Phase?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">相？</span></div>", "b": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">A part of a system that is uniform in composition and properties.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">体系中组成和性质都均一的部分。</span></div>"}, {"id": "c2-system-phase.c2", "f": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Phases in oil + water? In salt water?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">油＋水有几个相？盐水呢？</span></div>", "b": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Oil + water: 2. Salt water: 1.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">油＋水：2。盐水：1。</span></div>"}, {"id": "c2-system-phase.c3", "f": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">A mixture of two gases: how many phases?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">两种气体的混合物有几个相？</span></div>", "b": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Always 1.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">永远是 1 个。</span></div>"}, {"id": "c2-system-phase.c4", "f": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">What does a visible boundary tell you?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">看得见分界线说明什么？</span></div>", "b": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">There is more than one phase.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">不止一个相。</span></div>"}], "quiz": [{"id": "c2-states.d1", "q": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Which describes a gas?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">哪一项描述的是气体？</span></div>", "opts": ["<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Definite shape, definite volume</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">形状固定、体积固定</span></span>", "<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Indefinite shape, definite volume</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">形状不固定、体积固定</span></span>", "<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Definite shape, indefinite volume</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">形状固定、体积不固定</span></span>", "<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Indefinite shape, indefinite volume</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">形状不固定、体积不固定</span></span>"], "a": 3, "hint": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Gas fills the whole container.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">气体会充满整个容器。</span></div>", "ans": "", "why": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Correct: a gas fills any container, so neither shape nor volume is fixed.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">正确：气体充满任何容器，形状和体积都不固定。</span></div>", "whys": ["<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">That is a solid.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这是固体。</span></div>", "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">That is a liquid — it keeps its volume.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">这是液体——它保持体积。</span></div>", "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">No state has this combination.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">没有哪种状态是这样的组合。</span></div>", "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Correct: a gas fills any container, so neither shape nor volume is fixed.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">正确：气体充满任何容器，形状和体积都不固定。</span></div>"]}, {"id": "c2-states.d2", "q": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Why can a liquid flow but still keep a definite volume?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">液体为什么能流动，却仍保持固定体积？</span></div>", "opts": ["<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Its particles are far apart</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">粒子相距很远</span></span>", "<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Its particles touch but can slide past each other</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">粒子相互接触但能彼此滑动</span></span>", "<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Its particles are locked in a fixed pattern</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">粒子被固定在规则排列中</span></span>", "<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">It has no mass</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">它没有质量</span></span>"], "a": 1, "hint": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Two facts need two features: contact (volume) and sliding (flow).</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">两个现象对应两个特征：接触（体积）和滑动（流动）。</span></div>", "ans": "", "why": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Correct: touching keeps the volume fixed; sliding lets it flow.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">正确：相互接触使体积固定；能滑动使它能流动。</span></div>", "whys": ["<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Far-apart particles would make it compressible with indefinite volume — that is a gas.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">粒子相距远会使它可压缩、体积不固定——那是气体。</span></div>", "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Correct: touching keeps the volume fixed; sliding lets it flow.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">正确：相互接触使体积固定；能滑动使它能流动。</span></div>", "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Locked particles cannot flow — that is a solid.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">粒子被固定就不能流动——那是固体。</span></div>", "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">All matter, liquids included, has mass.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">所有物质（包括液体）都有质量。</span></div>"]}, {"id": "c2-properties.d1", "q": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Tin is rolled into thin sheets for cans. Which property?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">锡被轧成薄片做罐头。是哪种性质？</span></div>", "opts": ["<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Ductility</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">延性</span></span>", "<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Malleability</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">可锻性</span></span>", "<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Lustre</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">光泽</span></span>", "<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Viscosity</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">黏度</span></span>"], "a": 1, "hint": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Sheets → malleable.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">成片→可锻性。</span></div>", "ans": "", "why": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Correct: rolled into sheets without breaking = malleable.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">正确：轧成薄片而不破裂＝可锻性。</span></div>", "whys": ["<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Ductility is about wires, not sheets.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">延性指成丝，不是成片。</span></div>", "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Correct: rolled into sheets without breaking = malleable.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">正确：轧成薄片而不破裂＝可锻性。</span></div>", "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Lustre is about shine, not shaping.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">光泽说的是光亮，不是成形。</span></div>", "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Viscosity is for fluids flowing, not solids being shaped.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">黏度用于流体流动，不是固体成形。</span></div>"]}, {"id": "c2-properties.d2", "q": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Two jars are joined by an open tube. Jar A starts with many gas particles, jar B with very few. What happens?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">两个罐子由一根打开的管子连通。A 罐一开始有很多气体粒子，B 罐很少。会发生什么？</span></div>", "opts": ["<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Particles move from B to A until A is full</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">粒子从 B 移到 A，直到 A 满了</span></span>", "<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Nothing, because gases do not move on their own</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">什么都不会发生，气体不会自己动</span></span>", "<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Particles move from A to B until both have about the same concentration</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">粒子从 A 移到 B，直到两边浓度大致相同</span></span>", "<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">All particles move to B and A becomes empty</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">所有粒子移到 B，A 变空</span></span>"], "a": 2, "hint": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">High → low, and it ends at equilibrium.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">高→低，终点是平衡。</span></div>", "ans": "", "why": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Correct: net movement high → low until equilibrium.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">正确：净移动从高到低，直到平衡。</span></div>", "whys": ["<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Reverses the direction — diffusion goes high → low.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">方向反了——扩散是高→低。</span></div>", "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Gas particles are always moving; diffusion needs no push.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">气体粒子一直在运动；扩散不需要外力推动。</span></div>", "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Correct: net movement high → low until equilibrium.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">正确：净移动从高到低，直到平衡。</span></div>", "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Diffusion stops at balance (equilibrium), not when one side is empty.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">扩散在平衡时停止，而不是某一边变空。</span></div>"]}, {"id": "c2-system-phase.d1", "q": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">How many phases are in a beaker of water with sand settled at the bottom?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">烧杯里有水，底部沉着沙子，共有几个相？</span></div>", "opts": ["<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">1, because it is all in one beaker</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">1，因为都在一个烧杯里</span></span>", "<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">3, because sand has many grains</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">3，因为沙有很多颗粒</span></span>", "2", "<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">0, because it is a mixture</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">0，因为是混合物</span></span>"], "a": 2, "hint": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Count different states/parts, not containers or grains.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">数不同的状态／部分，不是数容器或颗粒。</span></div>", "ans": "", "why": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Correct: liquid water + solid sand = 2 phases (like the class calcium carbonate example).</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">正确：液态水＋固态沙＝2 个相（与讲义中碳酸钙的例子相同）。</span></div>", "whys": ["<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">One container is one system, not one phase.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">一个容器是一个体系，不是一个相。</span></div>", "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Many grains of the same solid still count as one solid phase.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">同一种固体的许多颗粒仍算一个固相。</span></div>", "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Correct: liquid water + solid sand = 2 phases (like the class calcium carbonate example).</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">正确：液态水＋固态沙＝2 个相（与讲义中碳酸钙的例子相同）。</span></div>", "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Every system has at least one phase.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">每个体系至少有一个相。</span></div>"]}, {"id": "c2-system-phase.d2", "q": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">A balloon is filled with helium and air. How many phases does the gas inside have?</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">气球里充了氦气和空气。里面的气体有几个相？</span></div>", "opts": ["1", "2", "<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">It depends on how much of each gas</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">取决于各种气体的量</span></span>", "<span class=\"bi chbi\"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">3, because air itself is several gases</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">3，因为空气本身就有好几种气体</span></span>"], "a": 0, "hint": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Gas particles are far apart and move freely, so they mix completely.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">气体粒子相距远、自由运动，所以完全混合。</span></div>", "ans": "", "why": "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Correct: gases always mix evenly, so any gas mixture is 1 phase.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">正确：气体总能均匀混合，任何气体混合物都是 1 个相。</span></div>", "whys": ["<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Correct: gases always mix evenly, so any gas mixture is 1 phase.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">正确：气体总能均匀混合，任何气体混合物都是 1 个相。</span></div>", "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Counts substances instead of phases.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">数的是物质，不是相。</span></div>", "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">The amounts do not matter — gases mix completely in any proportion.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">用量无关——气体以任意比例都能完全混合。</span></div>", "<div class=\"bi \"><span class=\"en\" lang=\"en\">Air has many gases but is still one phase.</span><span class=\"zh\" lang=\"zh-Hans\">空气含多种气体，但仍是一个相。</span></div>"]}], "v": 1, "key": "unit-u2"}